row(32, 19, 'MATERIAL', f'AND THE LORD SAW AND SPURNED, BECAUSE OF THE PROVOKING OF HIS SONS AND HIS DAUGHTERS. {HP(32, 19, (("וירא", "יהוה", "וינאץ"), "and the LORD saw and spurned — the narrative form (vayyiqtol, the consecutive past) opens the song\'s second movement"), (("מכעס", "בניו", "ובנתיו"), "from the provocation of His sons and His daughters — the daughters named"))} {AP(32, 19, (("וגלי", "קדם", "יי", "ותקף", "רגזיה"), "and it was REVEALED BEFORE the LORD and His anger grew strong — seeing rendered revelation before Him"), (("מדארגיזו", "קדמוהי", "בנין", "ובנן"), "because sons and daughters provoked before Him — His dropped from the children"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: God does not see, things are revealed before Him; the children no longer called His. DV32-07. Fresh.')
row(32, 20, 'MATERIAL', f'AND HE SAID: I WILL HIDE MY FACE FROM THEM, I WILL SEE WHAT THEIR END SHALL BE; FOR THEY ARE A VERY FROWARD GENERATION, CHILDREN IN WHOM IS NO FAITHFULNESS. {HP(32, 20, (("ויאמר", "אסתירה", "פני", "מהם"), "and He said: I will hide My face from them — astirah the cohortative, ONCE in the Bible; 31:17\'s \'and I will hide My face\' the kin (the ink)"), (("אראה", "מה", "אחריתם"), "I will see what their end shall be"), (("כי", "דור", "תהפכת", "המה"), "for a generation of overturnings are they"), (("בנים", "לא", "אמן", "בם"), "children in whom is no faithfulness"))} {AP(32, 20, (("ואמר", "אסלק", "שכנתי", "מנהון"), "and He said: I WILL REMOVE MY SHEKHINAH from them — the hidden face rendered the Presence withdrawn (31:17\'s and 31:18\'s rendering — the measure)"), (("גלי", "קדמי", "מא", "יהי", "בסופיהון"), "it is revealed before Me what shall be at their end — seeing rendered revelation again"), (("בניא", "דלית", "בהון", "הימנו"), "children in whom is no faith"))} THE HIDDEN FACE the song\'s own act — 31:17-18\'s foretold hiding now spoken in God\'s mouth (the compile: the face_hidden effect on the tape at 31:17; here its seat in the song). DV32-07. Fresh.')
row(32, 21, 'MATERIAL', f'THEY HAVE ROUSED ME TO JEALOUSY WITH A NO-GOD, PROVOKED ME WITH THEIR VANITIES; AND I WILL ROUSE THEM TO JEALOUSY WITH A NO-PEOPLE, WITH A VILE NATION I WILL PROVOKE THEM. {HP(32, 21, (("הם", "קנאוני", "בלא", "אל"), "they made Me jealous with a no-god — El the fourth in the song"), (("כעסוני", "בהבליהם"), "they provoked Me with their vanities"), (("ואני", "אקניאם", "בלא", "עם"), "and I will make them jealous with a no-people — the measure for measure"), (("בגוי", "נבל", "אכעיסם"), "with a vile nation I will provoke them — 32:6\'s foolish people answered by a foolish nation"))} {AP(32, 21, (("אנון", "אקניאו", "קדמי", "בלא", "דחלא"), "they provoked jealousy before Me with NO FEAR — the no-god rendered a no-fear"), (("ואנא", "אקננון", "בלא", "עם"), "and I will provoke them with a no-people"), (("בעמא", "טפשא", "ארגזנון"), "with a FOOLISH PEOPLE I will anger them — the vile nation rendered foolish"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: the no-god a no-fear. The compile: the no-people a reference ahead (the Prophets\' fulfilments cited, never read). DV32-07. Fresh.')
row(32, 22, 'MATERIAL', f'FOR A FIRE IS KINDLED IN MY NOSTRIL AND BURNS TO THE DEPTHS OF SHEOL, AND DEVOURS THE EARTH WITH HER PRODUCE AND SETS ABLAZE THE FOUNDATIONS OF THE MOUNTAINS. {HP(32, 22, (("כי", "אש", "קדחה", "באפי"), "for a fire is kindled in My anger — \'for\' (ki) the song\'s connective, nineteen in the chapter (the ink)"), (("ותיקד", "עד", "שאול", "תחתית"), "and burns to the lowest Sheol — Sheol named in the song"), (("ותאכל", "ארץ", "ויבלה"), "and devours the earth and her produce"), (("ותלהט", "מוסדי", "הרים"), "and sets ablaze the foundations of the mountains"))} {AP(32, 22, (("ארי", "קדום", "תקיף", "כאשא", "נפק", "מקדמי", "ברגז"), "for A STRONG EAST WIND like fire has gone out from before Me in anger — the fire rendered a wind, the nostril rendered anger"), (("ושצי", "עד", "שאול", "ארעית"), "and destroys to the lowest Sheol"), (("ושצית", "עד", "סיפי", "טוריא"), "and destroys to THE ENDS of the mountains — the foundations rendered the edges"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: no fire in God\'s nostril — a wind goes out from before Him. DV32-07. Fresh.')
row(32, 23, 'MATERIAL', f'I WILL HEAP EVILS UPON THEM, I WILL SPEND MY ARROWS UPON THEM. {HP(32, 23, (("אספה", "עלימו", "רעות"), "I will heap evils upon them — the poetic suffix (-mo) of the song"), (("חצי", "אכלה", "בם"), "My arrows I will spend on them — Sifrei 43:24 (outside): My arrows are spent and they are not spent"))} {AP(32, 23, (("אסף", "עליהון", "בישין"), "I will gather evils upon them"), (("מכתשי", "אשצי", "בהון"), "MY PLAGUES I will spend on them — the arrows rendered plagues"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: the arrows are plagues (the compile: the blows of 28:59-61 on the tape; the song names their stock). DV32-08. Fresh.')
