row(32, 36, 'MATERIAL', f'FOR THE LORD WILL JUDGE HIS PEOPLE AND REPENT HIMSELF FOR HIS SERVANTS, WHEN HE SEES THAT THEIR STAY IS GONE AND THERE IS NONE REMAINING, SHUT UP OR LEFT AT LARGE. {HP(32, 36, (("כי", "ידין", "יהוה", "עמו"), "for the LORD will judge His people — QUOTED WHOLE in Psalm 135:14 (seven in order — the Writings\' seat cited, never read; the ink)"), (("ועל", "עבדיו", "יתנחם"), "and for His servants He will relent"), (("כי", "יראה", "כי", "אזלת", "יד"), "when He sees that the hand is gone — \'for\' thrice in the verse"), (("ואפס", "עצור", "ועזוב"), "and none shut up or left — the pair of 1 Kings 14:10 and 21:21 (the Prophets\' seats cited)"))} {AP(32, 36, (("ארי", "ידין", "יי", "דינא", "דעמיה"), "for the LORD will judge THE JUDGMENT OF His people"), (("ופרענות", "עבדוהי", "צדיקיא", "יתפרע"), "and THE PUNISHMENT OF HIS RIGHTEOUS SERVANTS He will avenge — relenting rendered avenging, the servants made righteous"), (("יהון", "מטלטלין", "ושביקין"), "they shall be WANDERING AND FORSAKEN — the shut-up and the left rendered exiles"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: the judgment is for the people, the vengeance for the righteous servants; the enemy\'s stroke (machat sanaah) the occasion. The verse of the Sabbath-afternoon liturgy (the testing shelf, cited). DV32-11. Fresh.')
row(32, 37, 'MATERIAL', f'AND HE WILL SAY: WHERE ARE THEIR GODS, THE ROCK IN WHOM THEY TRUSTED? {HP(32, 37, (("ואמר", "אי", "אלהימו"), "and He will say: where are their gods — the poetic suffix again; no two-token kin (the ink)"), (("צור", "חסיו", "בו"), "the rock in whom they took refuge — the Rock the eighth and last of the song\'s rocks, here the idols\'"))} {AP(32, 37, (("ויימר", "אן", "דחלתהון"), "and He will say: where is THEIR FEAR — their gods rendered their fear (with 32:17, 32:21)"), (("תקיפא", "דהוו", "רחיצין", "ביה"), "the Mighty One in whom they trusted — the eighth takifa of the chapter, the idols\' rock given the same title (the measure)"))} Onkelos gives the false rock the true Rock\'s title — the title a noun of strength, not a Name. DV32-11. Fresh.')
row(32, 38, 'MATERIAL', f'WHO ATE THE FAT OF THEIR SACRIFICES AND DRANK THE WINE OF THEIR DRINK-OFFERING? LET THEM RISE UP AND HELP YOU, LET THEM BE YOUR PROTECTION. {HP(32, 38, (("אשר", "חלב", "זבחימו", "יאכלו"), "who ate the fat of their sacrifices — THE MISPRINTED HEAD: piska 328 opens with these words under a marker reading 32:35 (the split; sitting 19\'s lesson 1 in a head)"), (("ישתו", "יין", "נסיכם"), "drank the wine of their libation — the libation (nesekh) the offering vocabulary turned on the idols"), (("יקומו", "ויעזרכם"), "let them rise and help you — the second person plural (you) returns"), (("יהי", "עליכם", "סתרה"), "let there be over you a shelter"))} {AP(32, 38, (("די", "תרב", "נכסתהון", "הוו", "אכלין"), "who THE FAT (tarba) of their slaughterings used to eat — the fat given its Aramaic word (the measure)"), (("יקומון", "כען", "ויסעדונכון"), "let them rise NOW and support you — the now inserted"), (("יהון", "עליכון", "מגן"), "let them be over you A SHIELD — the shelter rendered a shield"))} DV32-11. Fresh.')
row(32, 39, 'MATERIAL', f'SEE NOW THAT I, EVEN I, AM HE, AND THERE IS NO GOD WITH ME; I KILL AND I MAKE ALIVE, I HAVE WOUNDED AND I HEAL, AND THERE IS NONE THAT CAN DELIVER OUT OF MY HAND. {HP(32, 39, (("ראו", "עתה", "כי", "אני", "אני", "הוא"), "see now that I, I am He — the imperative plural; THE THREE UNGLOSSED PRONOUNS: the store\'s gloss for \'ani\' (I) is \'?\' at this verse thrice (the display patch at the tail — the measure\'s seven)"), (("ואין", "אלהים", "עמדי"), "and there is no god with Me — Elohim the second in the song (32:17, 39)"), (("אני", "אמית", "ואחיה"), "I kill and I make alive — ONCE in the Bible (the ink)"), (("מחצתי", "ואני", "ארפא"), "I have wounded and I heal"), (("ואין", "מידי", "מציל"), "and none delivers from My hand"))} {AP(32, 39, (("חזו", "כען", "ארי", "אנא", "אנא", "הוא"), "see now that I, I am He — word for word"), (("ולית", "אלה", "בר", "מני"), "and there is no god APART FROM ME — with rendered beside"), (("אנא", "ממית", "ומחיי", "מחינא", "ואף", "מסינא"), "I kill and make alive, I have smitten and I also heal"))} THE SONG\'S CREED — the verse of the resurrection in the tradition (the Babylonian Talmud Pesachim 68a and Sanhedrin 91b the testing shelf, cited, never read); the compile: no law, the declaration a status of the Speaker. DV32-12. Fresh.')
row(32, 40, 'MATERIAL', f'FOR I LIFT UP MY HAND TO HEAVEN AND SAY: AS I LIVE FOREVER. {HP(32, 40, (("כי", "אשא", "אל", "שמים", "ידי"), "for I lift My hand to heaven — ONCE in the Bible (the ink); the oath gesture"), (("ואמרתי", "חי", "אנכי", "לעלם"), "and I say: I live forever — \'anokhi\' (I) the fourth unglossed pronoun (the store\'s \'?\')"))} {AP(32, 40, (("ארי", "אתקנית", "בשמיא", "בית", "שכנתי"), "for I HAVE ESTABLISHED IN HEAVEN THE HOUSE OF MY SHEKHINAH — the lifted hand rendered the Presence\'s dwelling (the measure)"), (("ואמרית", "קים", "אנא", "לעלמין"), "and I have said: I endure forever — living rendered enduring, the age plural"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: no hand raised — a house established in heaven; the oath by God\'s own life kept. DV32-12. Fresh.')
row(32, 41, 'MATERIAL', f'IF I WHET MY GLITTERING SWORD AND MY HAND TAKE HOLD ON JUDGMENT, I WILL RENDER VENGEANCE TO MY ADVERSARIES AND RECOMPENSE THOSE THAT HATE ME. {HP(32, 41, (("אם", "שנותי", "ברק", "חרבי"), "if I whet the lightning of My sword — \'if\' at 32:30 and here, the chapter\'s two (the ink)"), (("ותאחז", "במשפט", "ידי"), "and My hand takes hold on judgment"), (("אשיב", "נקם", "לצרי"), "I will return vengeance to My adversaries — vengeance the second of three"), (("ולמשנאי", "אשלם"), "and to those who hate Me I will repay"))} {AP(32, 41, (("אם", "על", "חד", "תרין", "כחזו", "ברקא"), "if TWOFOLD like the appearance of lightning — the glitter made a double flash"), (("מסוף", "שמיא", "ועד", "סוף", "שמיא", "תתגלי", "חרבי"), "from one end of heaven to the other My sword shall be revealed — the sky-wide sword"), (("אתב", "פרענותא", "לסנאי"), "I will return punishment to My enemies"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: the whetted sword a lightning across the whole sky. DV32-12. Fresh.')
row(32, 42, 'MATERIAL', f'I WILL MAKE MY ARROWS DRUNK WITH BLOOD AND MY SWORD SHALL DEVOUR FLESH, WITH THE BLOOD OF THE SLAIN AND THE CAPTIVES, FROM THE LONG-HAIRED HEADS OF THE ENEMY. {HP(32, 42, (("אשכיר", "חצי", "מדם"), "I will make My arrows drunk with blood"), (("וחרבי", "תאכל", "בשר"), "and My sword shall eat flesh"), (("מדם", "חלל", "ושביה"), "from the blood of the slain and the captive"), (("מראש", "פרעות", "אויב"), "from the head of the enemy\'s leaders (or long hair — the noun disputed)"))} {AP(32, 42, (("ארוי", "גירי", "מדמא"), "I will make My arrows drunk with blood"), (("וחרבי", "תקטול", "בעממיא"), "and My sword shall SLAY AMONG THE NATIONS — the flesh named the nations\'"), (("לאעדאה", "כתרין", "מריש", "סנאה"), "TO REMOVE THE CROWNS from the head of the enemy — the long hair rendered crowns"))} Onkelos writes the meaning: the disputed noun made the enemy\'s crown. DV32-12. Fresh.')
row(32, 43, 'MATERIAL', f'SING ALOUD, O NATIONS, OF HIS PEOPLE; FOR HE AVENGES THE BLOOD OF HIS SERVANTS AND RENDERS VENGEANCE TO HIS ADVERSARIES, AND MAKES EXPIATION FOR THE LAND OF HIS PEOPLE. {HP(32, 43, (("הרנינו", "גוים", "עמו"), "sing, O nations, His people — the imperative plural, the song\'s last"), (("כי", "דם", "עבדיו", "יקום"), "for the blood of His servants He avenges"), (("ונקם", "ישיב", "לצריו"), "and vengeance He returns to His adversaries — the third vengeance"), (("וכפר", "אדמתו", "עמו"), "and He expiates His land, His people — the verb of atonement (kipper) closing the song"))} {AP(32, 43, (("שבחו", "עממיא", "עמיה"), "PRAISE, O peoples, His people"), (("ארי", "פרענות", "עבדוהי", "צדיקיא", "יתפרע"), "for the punishment of His righteous servants He avenges — the servants righteous again (with 32:36)"), (("ויכפר", "על", "ארעיה", "ועל", "עמיה"), "and He will atone for His land and for His people — the two objects given their prepositions"))} THE SONG\'S LAST VERSE — the unit deu_32_haazinu closes here (32:1-43, forty-three steps); the compile: the atonement for the land a declared future, no write. DV32-12. Fresh.')
row(32, 44, 'MATERIAL', f'AND MOSES CAME AND SPOKE ALL THE WORDS OF THIS SONG IN THE EARS OF THE PEOPLE, HE AND HOSHEA THE SON OF NUN. {HP(32, 44, (("ויבא", "משה", "וידבר"), "and Moses came and spoke — the frame\'s narrative form"), (("את", "כל", "דברי", "השירה", "הזאת"), "all the words of this song — 31:30\'s three in order (the ink); \'this song\' seven in the Torah"), (("באזני", "העם"), "in the ears of the people — with Exodus 11:2 and 24:7 (the ink)"), (("הוא", "והושע", "בן", "נון"), "he and HOSHEA son of Nun — the old name of Numbers 13:16 (the tape\'s joshua_name on the kin), its one return"))} {AP(32, 44, (("ואתא", "משה", "ומליל"), "and Moses came and spoke"), (("ית", "כל", "פתגמי", "תשבחתא", "הדא"), "all the words of THIS PRAISE (tushbachta) — the song rendered praise, as at 31:22 and 31:30 (the measure)"), (("קדם", "עמא", "הוא", "והושע", "בר", "נון"), "before the people, he and Hoshea son of Nun — the ears rendered before"))} THE FRAME OPENS — the second unit deu_32_song_aftermath (32:44-52); Sifrei 334 reads the two speakers. The compile: the song taught (31:22\'s song_taught effect on the tape) — here its performance, a reference row. DV32A-01. Fresh.')
row(32, 45, 'MATERIAL', f'AND WHEN MOSES MADE AN END OF SPEAKING ALL THESE WORDS TO ALL ISRAEL. {HP(32, 45, (("ויכל", "משה", "לדבר"), "and Moses finished speaking — 31:1\'s kin (five in order — the ink)"), (("את", "כל", "הדברים", "האלה", "אל", "כל", "ישראל"), "all these words to all Israel"))} {AP(32, 45, (("ושצי", "משה", "למללא"), "and Moses finished speaking"), (("ית", "כל", "פתגמיא", "האלין", "עם", "כל", "ישראל"), "all these words WITH all Israel — to rendered with"))} Onkelos word for word. DV32A-01. Fresh.')
row(32, 46, 'MATERIAL', f'HE SAID TO THEM: SET YOUR HEART TO ALL THE WORDS WHICH I TESTIFY AGAINST YOU THIS DAY, THAT YOU MAY COMMAND YOUR CHILDREN TO OBSERVE TO DO ALL THE WORDS OF THIS LAW. {HP(32, 46, (("ויאמר", "אלהם", "שימו", "לבבכם"), "and he said to them: set your heart — the imperative; \'set your heart\' here and Haggai thrice (the ink)"), (("אשר", "אנכי", "מעיד", "בכם", "היום"), "which I testify against you this day — \'anokhi\' the fifth unglossed pronoun; the witness verb of 4:26, 30:19, 31:28"), (("אשר", "תצום", "את", "בניכם"), "that you command your children"), (("לשמר", "לעשות", "את", "כל", "דברי", "התורה", "הזאת"), "to observe to do all the words of this law — 31:12\'s six in order (the ink); 28:58\'s and 29:28\'s phrase"))} {AP(32, 46, (("שוו", "לבכון", "לכל", "פתגמיא"), "set your heart to all the words"), (("די", "אנא", "מסהד", "בכון", "יומא", "דין"), "which I testify against you this day"), (("למטר", "למעבד", "ית", "כל", "פתגמי", "אוריתא", "הדא"), "to keep, to do all the words of THIS TORAH (oraita) — the Torah\'s third seat in the chapter (32:6, 10, 46 — the measure)"))} THE CHARGE AFTER THE SONG — the children commanded (6:7\'s teaching on the tape); Sifrei 335 the spine. The compile: a status (the words set on the heart), the teaching a reuse. DV32A-02. Fresh.')
row(32, 47, 'MATERIAL', f'FOR IT IS NO VAIN THING FOR YOU, BECAUSE IT IS YOUR LIFE, AND THROUGH THIS THING YOU SHALL PROLONG YOUR DAYS ON THE LAND WHICH YOU GO OVER THE JORDAN TO POSSESS. {HP(32, 47, (("כי", "לא", "דבר", "רק", "הוא", "מכם"), "for it is no empty thing for you — Sifrei 48:2 and 48:10 (outside) read it: the thing you call empty is your life"), (("כי", "הוא", "חייכם"), "for it is your life — ONCE in the Bible (the ink)"), (("ובדבר", "הזה", "תאריכו", "ימים", "על", "האדמה"), "and by this thing you shall prolong days on the land — 11:9\'s five in order (the ink)"), (("אשר", "אתם", "עברים", "את", "הירדן", "שמה", "לרשתה"), "which you are crossing the Jordan there to possess"))} {AP(32, 47, (("ארי", "לא", "פתגם", "רקא", "הוא", "מנכון"), "for it is no empty word from you"), (("ארי", "הוא", "חייכון"), "for it is your life"), (("ובפתגמא", "הדין", "תורכון", "יומין", "על", "ארעא"), "and by this word you shall prolong days on the land"))} Onkelos word for word. The compile: the long-days effect (11:9\'s days_prolonged on the tape) reused as the charge\'s promise. DV32A-02. Fresh.')
row(32, 48, 'MATERIAL', f'AND THE LORD SPOKE TO MOSES THAT SELFSAME DAY, SAYING. {HP(32, 48, (("וידבר", "יהוה", "אל", "משה"), "and the LORD spoke to Moses — the divine frame ONCE in the chapter (the measure)"), (("בעצם", "היום", "הזה", "לאמר"), "in the selfsame day, saying — \'the selfsame day\' the eleventh in the Torah (Genesis 7:13, 17:23, 17:26; Exodus 12:17, 41, 51; Leviticus 23:21-30 — the ink); \'saying\' the chapter\'s one"))} {AP(32, 48, (("ומליל", "יי", "עם", "משה"), "and the LORD spoke with Moses"), (("בכרן", "יומא", "הדין", "למימר"), "IN THE MIDDLE (keran — the height) of this day, saying — the selfsame rendered the day\'s middle (the measure)"))} THE DAY — NO MARKER in the reading: the selfsame day is 19b\'s marker (40, 12, 7), Moses\' last day, on which the compile seats the summons (20b). Sifrei 337 reads the phrase with the flood\'s boarding and the exodus (the kin the measure found: Genesis 7:13, Exodus 12:17). DV32A-03. Fresh.')
row(32, 49, 'MATERIAL', f'GO UP INTO THIS MOUNTAIN OF ABARIM, TO MOUNT NEBO, WHICH IS IN THE LAND OF MOAB THAT IS OVER AGAINST JERICHO, AND BEHOLD THE LAND OF CANAAN WHICH I GIVE TO THE CHILDREN OF ISRAEL FOR A POSSESSION. {HP(32, 49, (("עלה", "אל", "הר", "העברים", "הזה", "הר", "נבו"), "go up to this mountain of the Abarim, Mount Nebo — Numbers 27:12\'s five in order (ten shared — the ink); \'Mount Nebo\' here and 34:1 alone; Sifrei 37:11 (outside) counts the mountain\'s three names, 355:6 places it in Reuben"), (("אשר", "בארץ", "מואב", "אשר", "על", "פני", "ירחו"), "which is in the land of Moab, facing Jericho"), (("וראה", "את", "ארץ", "כנען"), "and see the land of Canaan — the second imperative of the verse (go up, see)"), (("אשר", "אני", "נתן", "לבני", "ישראל", "לאחזה"), "which I give to the children of Israel for a possession — \'ani\' the sixth unglossed pronoun"))} {AP(32, 49, (("סק", "לטורא", "דעבראי", "הדין", "טורא", "דנבו"), "go up to this mountain of the Abarim, the mountain of Nebo"), (("וחזי", "ית", "ארעא", "דכנען"), "and see the land of Canaan"), (("די", "אנא", "יהב", "לבני", "ישראל", "לאחסנא"), "which I give to the children of Israel for an inheritance"))} THE SUMMONS TO NEBO — Numbers 27:12-14 repeated (the commission\'s mountain, compiled at opening_speech; a REFERENCE by the ink\'s own words); Onkelos word for word. DV32A-03. Fresh.')
row(32, 50, 'MATERIAL', f'AND DIE IN THE MOUNT WHERE YOU GO UP AND BE GATHERED TO YOUR PEOPLE, AS AARON YOUR BROTHER DIED IN MOUNT HOR AND WAS GATHERED TO HIS PEOPLE. {HP(32, 50, (("ומת", "בהר", "אשר", "אתה", "עלה", "שמה"), "and die on the mountain where you go up — the imperative \'die\', the chapter\'s eleventh"), (("והאסף", "אל", "עמיך"), "and be gathered to your people — the twelfth imperative; \'be gathered to your people\' in this form ONCE (the ink); Numbers 27:13\'s kin"), (("כאשר", "מת", "אהרן", "אחיך", "בהר", "ההר"), "as Aaron your brother died in Mount Hor — ONCE in the Bible (the ink); Numbers 20:28 and 33:38 the tape\'s entries"), (("ויאסף", "אל", "עמיו"), "and was gathered to his people"))} {AP(32, 50, (("ומות", "בטורא", "די", "את", "סלק", "לתמן"), "and die on the mountain that you go up to there"), (("ותתכנש", "לעמך"), "and be gathered to your people"), (("כמא", "דמית", "אהרן", "אחוך", "בהור", "טורא"), "as Aaron your brother died in Hor the mountain — the name kept, the order turned"))} THE DEATH COMMANDED — the compile: Moses\' death the tape event at 34:5; here its order under the retelling rules (a declared future); Aaron\'s death the receipt (a RUN CITATION of the tape\'s own entry). DV32A-03. Fresh.')
row(32, 51, 'MATERIAL', f'BECAUSE YOU TRESPASSED AGAINST ME IN THE MIDST OF THE CHILDREN OF ISRAEL AT THE WATERS OF MERIBATH-KADESH IN THE WILDERNESS OF ZIN, BECAUSE YOU DID NOT SANCTIFY ME IN THE MIDST OF THE CHILDREN OF ISRAEL. {HP(32, 51, (("על", "אשר", "מעלתם", "בי"), "because you (plural) trespassed against Me — Moses and Aaron both, the plural of Numbers 20:12"), (("במי", "מריבת", "קדש", "מדבר", "צן"), "at the waters of Meribath-kadesh in the wilderness of Zin — Numbers 27:14\'s four in order (the ink); Meribath-kadesh here, Numbers 27:14 and Ezekiel 48:28 alone"), (("על", "אשר", "לא", "קדשתם", "אותי"), "because you did not sanctify Me — the sin named twice"))} {AP(32, 51, (("על", "די", "שקרתון", "במימרי"), "because you DEALT FALSELY WITH MY WORD (meimri) — trespass rendered falsehood against the Memra"), (("במי", "מצות", "רקם", "מדברא", "דצן"), "at the waters of THE STRIFE OF REKEM in the wilderness of Zin — Kadesh rendered Rekem (with 33:8 — the measure)"), (("על", "די", "לא", "קדשתון", "יתי"), "because you did not sanctify Me"))} THE REASON — Numbers 20:12\'s sentence read back (the tape\'s own entry, a RUN CITATION); Onkelos names the place by its Aramaic name Rekem. DV32A-04. Fresh.')
row(32, 52, 'MATERIAL', f'FOR YOU SHALL SEE THE LAND BEFORE YOU, BUT THERE YOU SHALL NOT GO, INTO THE LAND WHICH I GIVE TO THE CHILDREN OF ISRAEL. {HP(32, 52, (("כי", "מנגד", "תראה", "את", "הארץ"), "for from afar you shall see the land"), (("ושמה", "לא", "תבוא", "אל", "הארץ"), "and there you shall not come — \'you shall not go there\' ONCE in this form; 34:4\'s \'there you shall not cross\' the kin (the ink); Sifrei 357:27 (outside, fresh) reads the two together — not king nor commoner, not alive nor dead"), (("אשר", "אני", "נתן", "לבני", "ישראל"), "which I give to the children of Israel — \'ani\' the seventh unglossed pronoun"))} {AP(32, 52, (("ארי", "מקבל", "תחזי", "ית", "ארעא"), "for from opposite you shall see the land"), (("ולתמן", "לא", "תעול", "לארעא"), "and there you shall not enter the land"))} THE CHAPTER\'S CLOSE — the sentence stands; the compile: Moses\' status (barred from the land, Numbers 20:12 on the tape) reaffirmed, a reference row; 34:4 ahead cited, never read (READ THEN COMPILE PER PORTION). DV32A-04. Fresh.')
